export anchor GridRow:
    description:
        Sets which row lines the child starts and ends on. A single value sets the start line only; `span` sets how many rows it covers.

    identifier: gridRow

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `grid-row` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `<line-number>`
        - `<line-name>`
        - `span <count>`
        - `<start> / <end>`

    initial: auto

    appliesTo: Grid items (children of a grid container).

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            gridRow: 1 / -1
        \\\
        ```
